  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1788290962_4270142_af76a6c2ec3b4c34bbee930b88a0c1fb.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">About our brand and products:<br>We create premium travel backpacks with built-in vacuum compression technology, available in 17L, 28L, and 34L sizes. Our bags help travelers pack more efficiently by compressing clothes and soft items, freeing up space and keeping belongings organized and compact — perfect for carry-on travel and minimalist packing.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">What makes us different:<br>Unlike standard travel backpacks, ours feature an integrated vacuum pump that actively compresses packed items, reducing bulk without the need for separate compression bags or accessories. This gives travelers more usable space, lighter loads, and a cleaner packing system — all in one product.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">How affiliates can earn:<br>Affiliates earn a 15% commission on every sale generated through their unique referral link. Commission is calculated on the product price only (excluding tax, shipping, shipping tax, and tips).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">How to promote us:<br>Share your unique affiliate link on social media, travel blogs, YouTube reviews, or packing/travel content. Our product performs especially well with content showing before/after packing comparisons, travel vlogs, carry-on packing tips, and minimalist/digital nomad lifestyle content.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Other information:<br>Our target audience includes frequent travelers, digital nomads, backpackers, and minimalist packers looking for smart, space-saving travel solutions. We provide affiliates with product images and support to help create effective promotional content.</span></p></div>",
